---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Company & Manifesto — Solstice-AI"
  description="Solstice-AI builds open infrastructure for frontier AI — multi-teacher datasets, quantized models, and distillation tooling."
>
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <div class="container company-top-container">
    <div class="page-header-banner">
      <span class="eyebrow mono">MANIFESTO &bull; PHILOSOPHY &bull; ROADMAP</span>
      <h1>Open Frontier Infrastructure</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        We believe the frontier of intelligence should not be locked behind closed APIs. Solstice-AI builds open datasets, model weights, and distillation systems that empower researchers and engineers globally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Operating Principles Grid -->
  <section class="section border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head-split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow mono">OPERATING PRINCIPLES</span>
          <h2>Why We Build in the Open</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Brute-force scale is failing. Efficient distillation on verified consensus reasoning is how intelligence democratizes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="principles-grid">
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="p-top mono">
            <span class="p-num">01</span>
            <span class="p-tag">METHODOLOGY</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Multi-Teacher Neutrality</h3>
          <p>
            Distilling from a single proprietary model inevitably inherits its unique blind spots, stylistic tropes, and safety hallucinations. We curate balanced consensus traces across 8 diverse frontier architectures to train resilient student models.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="p-top mono">
            <span class="p-num">02</span>
            <span class="p-tag">OPEN SCIENCE</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Radical Artifact Transparency</h3>
          <p>
            We do not publish gated previews or selective cherry-picked benchmarks. Every release includes complete Apache Parquet dataset archives, uncensored chain-of-thought scratchpads, training recipes, and AGPL-3.0 model weights.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="p-top mono">
            <span class="p-num">03</span>
            <span class="p-tag">SOVEREIGNTY</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sub-8B Local Hardware Sovereignty</h3>
          <p>
            True intelligence democratization requires running frontier reasoning on commodity local hardware. We optimize our distillation pipelines specifically for sub-8B parameter architectures that run comfortably on single consumer GPUs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="p-top mono">
            <span class="p-num">04</span>
            <span class="p-tag">VERIFICATION</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Step-Level Verification</h3>
          <p>
            More data does not equal better reasoning. Every trace in our corpora passes automated compiler execution, mathematical assertion checks, and step-level backtracking validation before inclusion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Roadmap Section -->
  <section class="section border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head-split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow mono">EXECUTION TRAJECTORY</span>
          <h2>Infrastructure Roadmap</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mono">2026 — 2027 Post-Training Milestones</p>
      </div>

      <div class="roadmap-grid-list">
        <div class="roadmap-row">
          <div class="r-meta mono">
            <span class="badge rose">AUG 2026</span>
            <span class="r-status-done">RELEASED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="r-main">
            <h3>Solace 1.0 Omni & Axiom Distillation Corpora</h3>
            <p>
              12,586,893 unique conversations (137.7 GB JSONL, 60 source datasets) and Project Axiom (102 GB CoT, 27B+ tokens) across 7 frontier architectures. Exact SHA256 deduplicated, published under AGPL-3.0 on Hugging Face Hub.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="roadmap-row active-milestone">
          <div class="r-meta mono">
            <span class="badge amber">Q4 2026</span>
            <span class="r-status-active">IN PROGRESS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="r-main">
            <h3>Solace-Sub8B Checkpoints (FP8 & AWQ)</h3>
            <p>
              Release of calibrated 3.8B and 7B reasoning checkpoints fine-tuned on Solace 1.0 activation datasets. Native inference support for vLLM, llama.cpp, and Apple MLX.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="roadmap-row">
          <div class="r-meta mono">
            <span class="badge">Q1 2027</span>
            <span class="r-status-planned">PLANNED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="r-main">
            <h3>Equinox: Continuous Distillation Harness</h3>
            <p>
              Automated pipelines for streaming multi-teacher consensus traces directly into online fine-tuning clusters with continuous compiler assertion feedback.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="roadmap-row">
          <div class="r-meta mono">
            <span class="badge">Q2 2027</span>
            <span class="r-status-planned">PLANNED</span>
          </div>
          <div class="r-main">
            <h3>Formal Mathematical Verification Sandbox</h3>
            <p>
              Integration of Lean 4 and Isabelle formal proof checkers for automated step-by-step mathematical reasoning validation in synthetic datasets.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact & Collaboration -->
  <section class="section" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-card-wrapper">
        <div class="contact-card">
          <span class="eyebrow mono">ENTERPRISE & RESEARCH COLLABORATION</span>
          <h2>Deploy With Solstice-AI</h2>
          <p>
            Whether you are evaluating Solace corpora, benchmarking Anvil with TurboQuant on local clusters, or deploying private air-gapped sovereign instances for your organization, reach out directly.
          </p>
          <div class="contact-btn-row">
            <a href="mailto:contact@solstice-ai.co" class="btn solid">
              <div class="btn-inner">
                <span class="btn-text">contact@solstice-ai.co</span>
                <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:research@solstice-ai.co" class="btn">
              <div class="btn-inner">
                <span class="btn-text">Research Labs</span>
                <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
              </div>
            </a>
            <a href="https://huggingface.co/Solstice-AI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn rose">
              <div class="btn-inner">
                <span class="btn-text">Hugging Face Hub</span>
                <span class="btn-arrow">↗</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .company-top-container {
    padding-top: 48px;
  }

  .page-header-banner {
    padding: 64px 40px 48px;
    width: 100%;
    border: var(--border);
    background: var(--negative);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .page-header-banner h1 {
    margin: 4px 0 8px;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--positive-muted);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .section-head-split {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 64px 40px 36px;
    border-left: var(--border);
    border-right: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .section-head-split p {
    max-width: 480px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--positive-muted);
  }

  /* Principles Grid */
  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    border-left: var(--border);
    border-right: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
  }

  .principle-card {
    padding: 48px 40px;
    border-right: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--negative);
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .principle-card:nth-child(2n) {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .principle-card:nth-last-child(-n+2) {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .p-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .p-num {
    color: var(--rose);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .p-tag {
    color: var(--positive-dim);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .principle-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .principle-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--positive-muted);
  }

  /* Roadmap List */
  .roadmap-grid-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-left: var(--border);
    border-right: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
  }

  .roadmap-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 36px;
    padding: 36px 40px;
    border-bottom: var(--border);
    background: var(--negative);
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .roadmap-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .roadmap-row.active-milestone {
    background: var(--negative-dark);
  }

  .r-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .badge.rose {
    background: var(--rose);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .badge.amber {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .badge {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .r-status-done {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .r-status-active {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .r-status-planned {
    color: var(--positive-dim);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }

  .r-main h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .r-main p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--positive-muted);
  }

  /* Contact Card */
  .contact-card-wrapper {
    padding: 64px 0 96px;
    border-left: var(--border);
    border-right: var(--border);
    border-bottom: var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -58deg,
      rgba(206, 190, 190, 0.08) 0 1px,
      transparent 1px 12px
    );
    border: var(--border);
    border-top-left-radius: 18px 26px;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 18px 26px;
    padding: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 800px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 40px;
  }

  .contact-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
  }

  .contact-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--positive-muted);
  }

  .contact-btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .principle-card {
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: var(--border);
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }
    .principle-card:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .roadmap-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }
    .page-header-banner, .section-head-split {
      padding: 36px 20px;
    }
    .contact-card {
      padding: 32px 20px;
      margin: 0 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
